{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"“无穷小景”"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"无穷小景"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>对于开集\n$$\r\nU\\hookrightarrow X\r\n$$\n考虑无穷小嵌入 $U\\hookrightarrow T$, 使得 $\\mathcal O_U = \\mathcal O_T\\big/ \\text{幂零元}$.</p>\n<p>于是 $D$ 模可视为\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{QCoh}(X_{\\text{inf}}) = D\\mathsf{-Mod}(X).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>相关概念: "},{"Local":{"url":"deRham空间","text":"de Rham 空间"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}